><section1
id="s1"
><secTitle
></secTitle
><p
>The following table shows the category and some features that are automatically mapped from the <object
type="tFLEx"
></object
> category abbreviation (column 2) to what is needed in the <object
type="tPcPatrGrammar"
></object
> generated by <object
type="tPAWS"
></object
> (column 3). These features do not need to be added in the <object
type="tFLEx"
></object
> lexicon in the “PCPATR” field. If column 3 is <object
type="tNone"
></object
> you will need to make an entry in <object
type="tFLEx"
></object
> in the "PCPATR” field directly following instructions in <object
type="tPAWS"
></object
> or in the help file in <object
type="tPcPatrFLEx"
></object
> to use that entry.</p
